-empty-space {border-left: none;border-top: 1px dashed var(--slate-300);padding-left: 0;padding-top: 32px;min-height: auto}\n  .plan-row-item {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 16px}\n  .plan-action-col {text-align: left}\n  .faq-list-item {grid-template-columns: 1fr;gap: 12px}\n}\n</style><header class=\"site-header\">\n  <div class=\"breadcrumbs-bar\">\n    <a href=\"#\">首页</a>\n    <span class=\"divider\">/</span>\n    <a href=\"#\">网络架构与分发矩阵</a>\n    <span class=\"divider\">/</span>\n    <strong>新界节点与订阅指引</strong>\n  </div>\n  <nav class=\"toc-bar\" aria-label=\"页面核心目录\">\n    <a href=\"#overview\">01. 体系概述</a>\n    <a href=\"#principles\">02. 架构设计原则</a>\n    <a href=\"#plans\">03. 资源规格方案</a>\n    <a href=\"#client-guide\">04. 客户端配置</a>\n    <a href=\"#faq\">05. 常见问题解答</a>\n  </nav>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"page-container\">\n  <section class=\"hero-layout\" id=\"overview\">\n    <div class=\"hero-narrow-col\">\n      <span class=\"hero-tag\">Routing &amp; Infrastructure</span>\n      <h1 class=\"hero-title\">新界</h1>\n      <div class=\"hero-prompt-qa\">\n        <p class=\"hero-prompt-q\">如何理解新界的核心任务？</p>\n        <p class=\"hero-prompt-a\">当多终端环境面临杂乱的跨域访问配置时，新界通过结构化的路由规则与按需划分的节点资源池，为个人与组织提供规范、低干预的数据中继方案。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-spec-matrix\">\n        <div class=\"spec-item\">\n          <span class=\"spec-label\">当前运行调度</span>\n          <span class=\"spec-val\">规则分流就绪</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"spec-item\">\n          <span class=\"spec-label\">支持协议规范</span>\n          <span class=\"spec-val\">跨平台通用标准</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"spec-item\">\n          <span class=\"spec-label\">资源分配模式</span>\n          <span class=\"spec-val\">按席位与配额隔离</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-empty-space\">\n      <div class=\"space-canvas-indicator\">SYS-REF // 09046-SCALE-INDEX</div>\n      <div class=\"space-statement-box\">\n        <p class=\"space-statement-q\">为什么坚持以留白和规范构建传输拓扑？</p>\n        <p class=\"space-statement-text\">网络资源配置的核心价值在于降低不确定性。我们剥除多余的包装辞藻，呈现客观的规格、清晰的设备限制与直截了当的参数设定，使用户对每单位流量的去向均有预估。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section-block\" id=\"principles\">\n    <div class=\"section-intro-guide\">\n      <div class=\"guide-question\">Question / 01</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">搭建环境前，应依循哪些网络调度逻辑？</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cards-grid\">\n      <article class=\"number-base-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-content-wrap\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-query-title\">分流规则如何实施？</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-answer-desc\">系统基于目标域名与 IP 归属地触发判定。内部通讯与大陆主流站点直接本地回环，跨域服务则经由新界中继链路解析，避免全量全局代理带来的带宽消耗。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card-bg-number\">01</div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"number-base-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-content-wrap\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-query-title\">节点资源池如何分层？</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-answer-desc\">依据不同传输负载，通用接入层处理常规轻量网页请求，原生与专线节点则专供高频流媒体及低延迟交互任务，彼此逻辑隔离，避免信道挤占。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card-bg-number\">02</div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"number-base-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-content-wrap\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-query-title\">设备上限如何管控？</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-answer-desc\">每个订阅对应固定的活跃并发会话数。当在线终端超出配额时，系统依据接入时间戳维持白名单列表，保障在网设备的会话连续性。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card-bg-number\">03</div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section-block\" id=\"plans\">\n    <div class=\"section-intro-guide\">\n      <div class=\"guide-question\">Question / 02</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">如何选择符合自身吞吐体量的方案？</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"plans-vertical-list\">\n      <article class=\"plan-row-item\">\n        <div class=\"plan-title-col\">\n          <h3>基础版</h3>\n          <p class=\"plan-sub-desc\">适用于个人单机或轻度查询场景</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing-col\">\n          <span class=\"plan-main-price\">¥15<small>/月</small></span>\n          <span class=\"plan-term-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-features-col\">\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>每月 100GB 流量配额</span>\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>支持 3 台设备同时在线</span>\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>基础流媒体访问</span>\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>普通线路节点池</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-action-col\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-btn\">选定基础方案</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-row-item highlighted\">\n        <div class=\"plan-title-col\">\n          <h3>旗舰版</h3>\n          <p class=\"plan-sub-desc\">兼顾日常多媒体消费与低延迟传输</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing-col\">\n          <span class=\"plan-main-price\">¥35<small>/月</small></span>\n          <span class=\"plan-term-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-features-col\">\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>每月 300GB 流量配额</span>\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>支持 5 台设备同时在线</span>\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>全节点原生流媒体解锁</span>\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</span>\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>7x24 优先工单支持</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-action-col\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-btn primary\">选定旗舰方案</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-row-item\">\n        <div class=\"plan-title-col\">\n          <h3>团队版</h3>\n          <p class=\"plan-sub-desc\">满足小型组织多席位协作与定制路由需求</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing-col\">\n          <span class=\"plan-main-price\">¥85<small>/月</small></span>\n          <span class=\"plan-term-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-features-col\">\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>每月 1000GB 流量配额</span>\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>支持 20 台设备同时在线</span>\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>VIP 专属高带宽节点</span>\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>支持企业定制路由</span>\n          <span class=\"feature-badge-item\"><span class=\"feature-bullet\"></span>专属客户经理服务</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"plan-action-col\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-btn\">选定团队方案</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section-block\" id=\"client-guide\">\n    <div class=\"section-intro-guide\">\n      <div class=\"guide-question\">Question / 03</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">如何将新界订阅接入不同操作系统？</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"setup-guide-box\">\n      <p>新界采用业界通用订阅协议标准。我们不提供绑定私有代码的闭源打包软件，用户可通过受信任的通用核心工具直接完成分发，保障配置自主性与系统清洁度。</p>\n      <div class=\"setup-step-grid\">\n        <div class=\"step-cell\">\n          <div class=\"step-index\">STEP 01</div>\n          <div class=\"step-title\">获取订阅凭证</div>\n          <p class=\"step-content\">确认方案生效后，在后台生成专属的基础订阅 URL 字符串，支持 Clash、Sing-Box 或通用内核格式。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-cell\">\n          <div class=\"step-index\">STEP 02</div>\n          <div class=\"step-title\">导入通用终端</div>\n          <p class=\"step-content\">在 Windows、macOS、iOS 或 Android 平台的通用代理管理工具中添加远程配置链接并触发拉取。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step-cell\">\n          <div class=\"step-index\">STEP 03</div>\n          <div class=\"step-title\">设定分流模式</div>\n          <p class=\"step-content\">推荐勾选“规则分流（Rule / PAC）”，确保本地回环与跨域访问分别匹配各自路由表，完成初始化配置。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section-block\" id=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"section-intro-guide\">\n      <div class=\"guide-question\">Question / 04</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-heading\">常见技术与账单问题解答</h2>\n    </div>\n    <ol class=\"faq-numbered-list\">\n      <li class=\"faq-list-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-index-sign\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-qa-body\">\n          <h3 class=\"faq-question-text\">新界的每月流量配额是如何结算与重置的？</h3>\n          <p class=\"faq-answer-text\">流量计算周期严格按照订单支付成功当天的账单周期（Billing Cycle）循环。例如，若在某月 15 日订阅，次月 15 日将自动重置当月额度。未消耗完的配额不结转至下一周期。</p>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li class=\"faq-list-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-index-sign\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-qa-body\">\n          <h3 class=\"faq-question-text\">同时在线设备数量是如何判定的？</h3>\n          <p class=\"faq-answer-text\">系统依据接入节点的活动 IP 与保持长连接的终端指纹进行综合会话统计。同一本地局域网内经由软路由等网关分流的设备，在网关出口处视作单一连接源。</p>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li class=\"faq-list-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-index-sign\">03</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-qa-body\">\n          <h3 class=\"faq-question-text\">旗舰版中的 IPLC 专线优化具有哪些技术特性？</h3>\n          <p class=\"faq-answer-text\">IPLC（国际私有租用线路）通道绕开常规公网互联节点的拥堵时段，具备物理端对端的低抖动特性，主要服务于实时竞技游戏回传与原生高清流媒体交互。</p>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li class=\"faq-list-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-index-sign\">04</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-qa-body\">\n          <h3 class=\"faq-question-text\">订阅更新失败或节点列表无法拉取时应如何排查？</h3>\n          <p class=\"faq-answer-text\">首先检查本机系统时间是否与标准网络时间保持精确同步；其次确认本地防火墙未拦截代理软件的配置端口；最后可尝试重新生成并更新订阅 URL。</p>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"site-footer\">\n  <div class=\"page-container footer-inner\">\n    <div>\n      <strong>新界网络资源方案</strong> — 规范化传输拓扑指引\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-note\">\n      ARCHITECTURE SPECIFICATION // NO. 9046\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>",
